      "writtenOn": "2018-09-12T18:56:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Isn\u0027t sys.exit() too drastic? There will be multiple types of OLTs (openolt, adtran, ..) being managed by VOLTHA. We should log / alarm, disable the logical device and continue.",
      "parentUuid": "83187a42_55e74be5",
      "range": {
