      "writtenOn": "2018-09-13T14:09:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "initialize_device_resource_range_and_pool actually is a blocking call since it reads from the KV store. In order to do it the non-blocking \"twisted\" way, it has to be yield-ed. Python \"@inlineCallback\" doesn\u0027t work well with __init__ function. So, it is moved out of __init__.",
      "parentUuid": "83187a42_55e74be5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1135,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1143,
        "endChar": 23
